          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "aislamiento is built on aislar \"to isolate\", made from isla \"island\", which is inherited from Latin īnsula (EtymDB): to be cut off like an island."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
