              "text": "añorar — \"to long for, to yearn for\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Añoro los veranos de mi infancia. I long for the summers of my childhood."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A little literary; it takes a direct object: añoro mi casa."
            }
          ]
